5. Dekker's Algorithm: Final and completed SolutionIdea is to use favoured thread notion to determine entry to the critical section. Favoured thread alternates between the thread providing mutual exclusion and avoiding deadlock, indefinite postponement, or lockstep synchronization. Idea: Combine flags (intent) + turn (priority).Execution: If both want to enter, turn decides who goes; after exit, turn is passed.Solution:  Ensures Mutual Exclusion, Progress, and Bounded Waiting.
